' 'FULL_COMMIT_SHA'\n本会话的 CLI 会将 submit、status、issue 请求写到 A2A_REQUEST_DIR 指向的本 attempt 专用 /tmp 目录；不直接连接 socket。queued=true 只表示已排队，不是门禁通过。最后结束回合，让 Stop hook 读取并转交；没有请求文件就不交付。请求文件不得进入 Git 提交。查状态用同一入口 status --task，问题上报用 issue --task --title --body。不要修改合同、验收程序或沙箱权限。"}},{"seq":27,"time":"2026-10-14T19:48:11.429Z","task":"T-081-self-report-unchanged","attempt":"d526e2da-6ec8-4c35-a8cc-f601d0355c38","type":"dispatched","details":{"attempt":{"task_id":"T-081-self-report-unchanged","attempt_id":"d526e2da-6ec8-4c35-a8cc-f601d0355c38","session_id":"30e4a282-8ef4-4ed6-b63b-fcdc9fcb48f8","fence":1,"spec_rev":1,"thread_id":"df680ef5-b5de-4751-878d-535a1d0bb814","runtime_mode":"workspace-write","turn_id":null,"runtime_identity":{"launch":"825b6de0-81e3-4d81-896f-cc7e0060f39c","thread":"df680ef5-b5de-4751-878d-535a1d0bb814","shell_pid":31000,"leader_pid":31001,"native_session":"fixture-native-825b6de0-81e3-4d81-896f-cc7e0060f39c"},"workspace":"/private/tmp/q76-q75u2pj4/c-nggcla9m/state/worktrees/fixture/T-081-self-report-unchanged-a1","base_commit":"30bb275647955895dce041f28ae2513d82e3ae38","card_snapshot_id":"700886dc-5748-4347-a3e8-8c79337eb81e","reclaimed":false,"owner":"T-081-self-report-unchanged","state":"claimed"}}},{"seq":28,"time":"2026-10-14T19:48:12.577Z","task":"T-081-self-report-unchanged","attempt":"d526e2da-6ec8-4c35-a8cc-f601d0355c38","type":"command_intent","details":{"argv":["git","-C","/private/tmp/q76-q75u2pj4/c-nggcla9m/repo","cat-file","-t","057182bb44a1ecf2748be97f4cba97b0e0190d9a"],"cwd":"/private/tmp/q76-q75u2pj4/c-nggcla9m/repo"}},{"seq":29,"time":"2026-10-14T19:48:12.582Z","task":"T-081-self-report-unchanged","attempt":"d526e2da-6ec8-4c35-a8cc-f601d0355c38","type":"command_result","details":{"argv":["git","-C","/private/tmp/q76-q75u2pj4/c-nggcla9m/repo","cat-file","-t","057182bb44a1ecf2748be97f4cba97b0e0190d9a"],"cwd":"/private/tmp/q76-q75u2pj4/c-nggcla9m/repo","stdout":"commit\n","stderr":"","exit":0,"returncode":0}},{"seq":30,"time":"2026-10-14T19:48:1